        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Target architecture. Current local path: Browser -&gt; Next.js rewrite -&gt; Waitress / Flask -&gt; PostgreSQL.&#10;Clinical backend, staff authorization, external integrations and file storage remain planned.&#10;Next.js renders the workspace in the browser; browsers never connect directly to the database.&#10;Application modules: Registration (implemented); Queues, Examinations, Billing and Documents (planned)." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
